## Common Anti-Patterns

- ❌ Skipping frontend build → ✅ Always run `npm run build:prod`
- ❌ Deploying without validation → ✅ Run `databricks bundle validate` first
- ❌ No environment separation → ✅ Use dev/staging/prod targets
- ❌ Manual resource creation in UI → ✅ Define all resources in `databricks.yml`
- ❌ Committing secrets to Git → ✅ Use Databricks Secrets and environment variables
- ❌ Including frontend source in bundle → ✅ Exclude source, include only built assets
- ❌ Testing only in production → ✅ Test in dev, then staging, then prod

